WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:06.367
Hey, it's me. I keep losing track of who
promised what in our meetings.

2
00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:07.601
Could we fix that?

3
00:00:07.951 --> 00:00:08.233
Sure.

4
00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:12.794
Tell me how a meeting ends for you, and
I'll build a first version while we talk.

5
00:00:13.144 --> 00:00:17.837
Everyone leaves with tasks. By Friday,
nobody remembers them.

6
00:00:23.137 --> 00:00:24.538
Here's a first version.

7
00:00:24.538 --> 00:00:27.463
It reads the meeting notes, finds every
promise,

8
00:00:27.463 --> 00:00:30.327
and puts it on a board, with a name and a
date.

9
00:00:30.677 --> 00:00:33.791
That's already useful. Can my team try it?

10
00:00:34.591 --> 00:00:37.791
Ana, Sam, have a look. And bring your
agents.

11
00:00:41.091 --> 00:00:42.518
We'll split the work.

12
00:00:42.518 --> 00:00:45.916
I take the board, Ana's agent takes the
reminders,

13
00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:49.518
and Sam's agent reviews every change
before it ships.

14
00:00:59.318 --> 00:01:03.862
Three people. Three agents. We just became
a software agency.
